Command used two standard pci-bridge devices with explicit nonzero slots and e1000 at slot 2.
Serial log: /tmp/avisor-phase108-nested-final.log
Exit: 124 (expected timeout termination)

Observed:
- Recursive topology: 00:03.0 -> 01:01.0 -> 02:02.0
- Both bridge subordinate bus values were tightened to 2
- e1000 BAR0: MMIO 0x10200000/0x20000
- e1000 BAR1: I/O port 0x40, CPU aperture 0x3eff0040/0x40
- Both bridge memory windows: 0x10200000-0x102fffff
- Both bridge I/O windows: 0x0-0xfff
- Bridge I/O and Memory forwarding command bits enabled

