Failure scans
-------------
Basic and nested logs scanned for PANIC, ASSERT, Data Abort, Unknown IRQ and no ownership; no such markers found.
The complete guest log contains the existing Phase 44 task-slot reuse self-test failure:
`FAIL: task 槽位未被实际复用` (first-pid and second-pid both reported as -1).
This matches the Phase 107 recorded limitation and is unrelated to PCI; the phase does not claim that test or the complete guest suite passed.

Known limits
------------
16-bit I/O ports only; bridge 32-bit I/O upper registers, prefetchable windows, bridge hotplug, downstream device passthrough/ownership and multi-level INTx swizzling are not implemented. No deliberate maximum-depth or maximum-device-capacity stress run was performed.
